* hello: console output and input through the I/O page.
* Prints a line of text, prints a number in octal, then echoes whatever
* input characters are waiting.
* RUNTIMES: direct exch user
         INCLUDE "rt_direct.cal"
         TBEGIN
         PUTS    MSG
         PUTNL
         S1      1234567
         PUTOCT
         PUTNL
ECHO     S0      T$CSTA,0                ; bit 2**0: an input character waits
         S0      S0<D'63
         JSP     DONE
         S1      T$CDAT,0
         PUTC
         J       ECHO
DONE     TPASS
         TEND
MSG      DATA    'HELLO, CRAY X-MP',0
         END
